      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: Use an existing group whenever a finding fits it; propose a new group
        only when none fits. Use a tool whose meaning already fits; only when no
        tool fits, take one from the list of free tools and give it a meaning. List
        a tool as taken into use only when you took it from that free list - a tool
        that already has a meaning keeps it and does not belong in that list, so
        leave the list empty when no tool was free. Choose a surface tool for an
        area and a line tool for a line or a small spot. When a finding covers both
        sides of the body or several body parts, name every region it covers. Anything
        that cannot be placed on a body region, and anything that concerns the patient
        as a whole, goes into one summarising text instead of a marking.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
